<title>HONG KONG: Bankers Trust sets warrants on HK conglomerates.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets warrants on HK conglomerates.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International Plc said on Wednesday it has issued 1.055 billion American-style call warrants on a basket of Hong Kong conglomerate shares.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> CITIC Pacific Ltd			0.010 shares</p>
<p> China Resources Enterprise Ltd     0.035 shares</p>
<p> Shanghai Industrial Holdings Ltd   0.025 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$2.1451   PREMIUM   16 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.0474   GEARING   4.76x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  16.FEB.98   EXER LOT  20,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG   PAYDATE   2-3 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$2.2580</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT</p>
<p>			 ISSUER'S DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
